  "description": "Generic, domain-agnostic DDD/CQRS building blocks for .NET 10: railway-oriented Result<T>, AuditableEntity/ImmutableEntity base classes, in-process domain events (dispatcher + handlers), ICurrentUserService, value objects (Money, Percentage, Geocoordinate), CacheKeyHash. No EF Core dependency — see Cayaqui.MPS.BuildingBlocks.EntityFrameworkCore for the EF integration (outbox, interceptors, scoped handlers). Proprietary — requires a commercial agreement with Cayaqui.",
